懂，长按就能AI点评\n7️⃣斗图没表情包，AI帮你找\n8️⃣扫一扫拍照也能问AI\n9️⃣未成年人模式上线  \n1️⃣0️⃣不加微信也能面对面收照片  \n1️⃣1️⃣自己发过的朋友圈终于能搜索  \n1️⃣2️⃣微信支付支持组合付款  \n1️⃣3️⃣视频通话可以横屏了\n你最喜欢哪个功能，评论区聊聊？","content":"<p>1️⃣语音AI快捷指令<br />2️⃣微信首页就能问小微<br />3️⃣看公众号文章能直接问小微<br />4️⃣视频号评论区也能问小微<br />5️⃣朋友圈文案不会写，AI帮你写<br />6️⃣朋友圈看不懂，长按就能AI点评<br />7️⃣斗图没表情包，AI帮你找<br />8️⃣扫一扫拍照也能问AI<br />9️⃣未成年人模式上线  <br />1️⃣0️⃣不加微信也能面对面收照片  <br />1️⃣1️⃣自己发过的朋友圈终于能搜索  <br />1️⃣2️⃣微信支付支持组合付款  <br />1️⃣3️⃣视频通话可以横屏了<br />你最喜欢哪个功能，评论区聊聊？</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz906tuXylhewNfR1f1hbe9VlkibAQvic6QulB7tUiaY1HdGwiatQtuPibuZCGpXFovl9tT4WWWDawP01zzgicmNcEyVZBDEfXL2yCX5aH0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz90602eKkgWpg5fx4T5zY1cr73ItEPZnIKyqXQQfgGE9QxtOmh9TMmO0eHo5fnWP38rQPOvCk5sWj4HkicS5nX5Fz5tTO7e6CSPFw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FKVER9adz905zSFrZeYr9AiaeHJwLtlVtdRibzToUkM4GE76qbK9fmiaKiaAnwZeXSe14AkcibTrF4dN0baP099bb86tmDwYOHnRcNU4niakk9liaVI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz905OmgjQLmvFeYnicjWmNWh8nJheOc39OwIUZ5c4KoGrZJ8Hkw1TpgzpvOXx7XbibcJXTxbcHylOuIuqa99b7pkDu5oGJfBC1mliaY%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FKVER9adz907fYjRibs4Ko8RCmX2pwgpibDkPJk1ZKhaYIrIldRrratg4APGnySZTIIVlXhicsPOGDPmV36cdiaT3fbBpxGUrw0xcfTxw3rQIqmw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FKVER9adz907dcXrBcHYMZD4icKq0lEFCcUkVgk6qiaBZicOcWY4JnSeN6ACHpgWnPMdQlUyXyk3ia8owSFBe0rH8djvycwdIVRkUBruoccqh198%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;